The program of omp-target-receive-arrays-reused.m on the machine's GPU: forty
regions receive arrays of 8 KiB to 512 KiB into arena memory that the regions
before them wrote, every element checked.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-receive-arrays-reused.m -o %t.O2
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY timeout -k 1 120 %t.O2 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-receive-arrays-reused.m --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY MERK_CHECK_MESSAGES=1 timeout -k 1 120 %t.O2 2>&1 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MESSAGES --match-full-lines
MESSAGES:Mercury runtime: 0 messages are neither read nor freed
